e each part:  \n     \\[\n     50 \\times 60 = 3000 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad 50 \\times 5 = 250\n     \\]\n   - Add the results:  \n     \\[\n     3000 + 250 = 3250\n     \\]\n\nBoth methods confirm the final answer is **3250**.\n\n**Answer:**  \n\\boxed{3250}",
