on via Estimation:**\n- \\(50 \\times 84 = 4200\\), so subtracting \\(1 \\times 84 = 84\\) gives \\(4200 - 84 = 4116\\), which is reasonable.\n\n**Final Answer:**  \nThe product of 49 and 84 is \\(\\boxed{4116}\\).",
