 - 150 + 2 = 2352\n   \\]\n\n3. **Simplifying with 50:**\n   \\[\n   49 \\times 48 = (50 - 1) \\times 48 = 50 \\times 48 - 48 = 2400 - 48 = 2352\n   \\]\n\nAll methods confirm the result is:\n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{2352}",
