 \\).  \n     \\( 2880 + 252 = 3132 \\).\n\n3. **Alternative method (FOIL):**\n   - \\( (30 + 6)(80 + 7) = 30 \\times 80 + 30 \\times 7 + 6 \\times 80 + 6 \\times 7 \\).  \n     \\( 2400 + 210 + 480 + 42 = 3132 \\).\n\n4. **Subtraction method:**\n   - \\( 36 \\times 87 = 36 \\times (90 - 3) = (36 \\times 90) - (36 \\times 3) \\).  \n     \\( 3240 - 108 = 3132 \\).\n\nAll methods confirm the result is consistent.\n\n**Answer:**  \n\\boxed{3132}",
