 + 3) \\times (60 + 6) = 90 \\times 60 + 90 \\times 6 + 3 \\times 60 + 3 \\times 6\n     \\]\n     \\[\n     = 5400 + 540 + 180 + 18 = 6138\n     \\]\n\n5. **Verification using the complement method:**\n   \\[\n   93 \\times 66 = (100 - 7) \\times 66 = 100 \\times 66 - 7 \\times 66\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   = 6600 - 462 = 6138\n   \\]\n\nAll methods confirm that the product of 93 and 66 is \\(\\boxed{6138}\\).",
