o \\(40 + 4\\):\n\n\\[\n19 \\times (40 + 4) = 19 \\times 40 + 19 \\times 4\n\\]\n\nCalculating each term:\n\n\\[\n19 \\times 40 = 760\n\\]\n\\[\n19 \\times 4 = 76\n\\]\n\nAdding these results together:\n\n\\[\n760 + 76 = 836\n\\]\n\nBoth methods confirm that the product of 19 and 44 is \\(\\boxed{836}\\).",
