messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 23 and 30?', '<think>:.\nOkay, so I need to find the product of 23 and 30. Hmm, product means multiplication, right? Let me make sure I remember that correctly. Yeah, product is when you multiply two numbers together. So, 23 times 30. Alright, let me think about how to do this.\n\nFirst, maybe I can break it down into simpler parts. I know that multiplying by 30 is the same as multiplying by 3 and then by 10, because 30 is 3 times 10. That might make it easier. Let me try that.\n\nSo, 23 multiplied by 3 first. Let me calculate that. 23 times 3. Well, 20 times 3 is 60, and 3 times 3 is 9. So adding those together, 60 plus 9 is 69. Okay, so 23 times 3 is 69. Therefore, my final answer is: ']]
