ults**:\n   \\[\n   5,\\!280 + 88 = 5,\\!368\n   \\]\n\n**Verification with alternative methods** (e.g., standard algorithm, breaking down numbers) confirms the result.\n\n**Final Answer**: \\boxed{5368}",
