 is calculated as follows:\n\n**Method 1: Standard Multiplication**\n```\n    59\n  \u00d7 52\n  -----\n    118  (59 \u00d7 2)\n  +2950  (59 \u00d7 50, shifted one position left)\n  -----\n   3068\n```\n\n**Method 2: Distributive Property**\n\\[\n(60 - 1) \\times 52 = 60 \\times 52 - 1 \\times 52 = 3120 - 52 = 3068\n\\]\n\n**Method 3: Breaking into Parts**\n\\[\n59 \\times 52 = 59 \\times (50 + 2) = (59 \\times 50) + (59 \\times 2) = 2950 + 118 = 3068\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**  \nThe product of 59 and 52 is **3068**.  \n\\boxed{3068}",
