 = 188\n   \\]\n\n3. Add the results of the two calculations:\n   \\[\n   2350 + 188 = 2350 + 100 + 88 = 2450 + 88 = 2538\n   \\]\n\nTo verify, we can also use the standard multiplication method:\n- Multiply 54 by 7: \\(54 \\times 7 = 378\\)\n- Multiply 54 by 40: \\(54 \\times 40 = 2160\\)\n- Add the results: \\(378 + 2160 = 2538\\)\n\nBoth methods confirm that the product of 54 and 47 is \\(\\boxed{2538}\\).",
