ion via distributive property:**\n   \\[\n   (90 + 6)(30 + 8) = 90 \\times 30 + 90 \\times 8 + 6 \\times 30 + 6 \\times 8\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   = 2,\\!700 + 720 + 180 + 48 = 3,\\!648\n   \\]\n\n3. **Alternative method (using subtraction):**\n   \\[\n   96 \\times 38 = (100 - 4) \\times 38 = 100 \\times 38 - 4 \\times 38\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   = 3,\\!800 - 152 = 3,\\!648\n   \\]\n\n**Final Answer:** \\boxed{3648}",
