Break down 47 into 40 and 7:\n     \\[\n     (40 + 7) \\times 80 = 40 \\times 80 + 7 \\times 80\n     \\]\n     Calculating each part:\n     \\[\n     40 \\times 80 = 3200 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad 7 \\times 80 = 560\n     \\]\n     Adding these results:\n     \\[\n     3200 + 560 = 3760\n     \\]\n\nAll methods confirm that the product of 47 and 80 is \\(\\boxed{3760}\\).",
