\n   \\]\n   \n2. **Calculate each part**:\n   - \\(21 \\times 60 = 1260\\)\n   - \\(21 \\times 1 = 21\\)\n\n3. **Sum the results**:\n   \\[\n   1260 + 21 = 1281\n   \\]\n\n**Verification via vertical multiplication**:\n```\n    21\n  \u00d7 61\n  -----\n     21   (21 \u00d7 1)\n  1260   (21 \u00d7 60, shifted left)\n  -----\n  1281\n```\n\n**Final Answer**: \\(\\boxed{1281}\\)",
