orithm:**  \n   - Multiply 75 by 3 (the digit in the tens place of 30):  \n     \\( 75 \\times 3 = 225 \\).  \n   - Add a zero at the end (since 30 has one zero):  \n     \\( 225 \\times 10 = 2250 \\).\n\nBoth methods confirm the result is **2250**.\n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{2250}",
