messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 13 and 60?', "<think>:.\nOkay, so I need to find the product of 13 and 60. Hmm, let me think. The product means multiplication, right? So I just have to multiply 13 by 60. Let me recall how to do this.\n\nFirst, maybe breaking it down would help. 13 times 60. I know that 60 is the same as 6 times 10. So maybe I can do 13 times 6 first and then multiply by 10. Let me try that.\n\n13 multiplied by 6. Let's see, 10 times 6 is 60, and 3 times 6 is 18. So adding those together, 60 + 18 is 78. Okay, so 13 times 6 is 78. Then I need to multiply that by 10. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
