7 by each part:  \n- \\( 17 \\times 50 = 850 \\)  \n- \\( 17 \\times 5 = 85 \\)  \n\n**Step 3:** Add the results:  \n\\( 850 + 85 = 935 \\).  \n\n**Verification using alternative methods:**  \n- **11's Trick:** \\( 17 \\times 5 \\times 11 = 85 \\times 11 = 935 \\).  \n- **Distributive Property:** \\( (10 + 7) \\times 55 = 10 \\times 55 + 7 \\times 55 = 550 + 385 = 935 \\).  \n\n**Final Answer:**  \n\\boxed{935}",
