 = (50 + 5) \\times 18 \\)\n   - \\( = (50 \\times 18) + (5 \\times 18) \\)\n   - \\( = 900 + 90 \\)\n   - \\( = 990 \\)\n\n4. **Alternative Factorization**:\n   - \\( 18 = 9 \\times 2 \\)\n   - \\( 55 \\times 9 = 495 \\)\n   - \\( 495 \\times 2 = 990 \\)\n\n**Final Answer**: \\(\\boxed{990}\\)",
