nation:**\n1. **Direct Multiplication:**  \n   Multiply 20 by 25 directly:  \n   \\[\n   20 \\times 25 = 500\n   \\]\n\n2. **Breaking Down Numbers:**  \n   - \\(20 = 2 \\times 10\\)  \n   - \\(25 \\times 2 = 50\\)  \n   - \\(50 \\times 10 = 500\\)\n\n3. **Verification Using Alternative Methods:**  \n   - Distributive property: \\(25 \\times (10 + 10) = 250 + 250 = 500\\).  \n   - Exponents: \\(20 \\times 25 = (2 \\times 10^1) \\times (25 \\times 10^0) = 50 \\times 10^1 = 500\\).  \n\nAll methods confirm the result is **500**.\n\n**Answer:**  \n\\boxed{500}",
